# Tribunal "Muckraking Journalist": Tienius Delitian wants the anonymous writer
# of 'The Common Tongue' silenced ("anonymous writer", "Tell me more about this
# mission." 1, then "I'll take care of it." 4: 1). Ten-Tongues Weerhat at the
# Pawnbroker, at disposition 80, names Trels Varis (20). In the Secret Office
# under the Craftsmen's Hall, told to stop
# printing lies (1), Trels takes a 3000-gold donation to the Widows and Orphans
# Fund instead (7: 60), and Tienius, told to cover the expenses (5), pays 8000
# (100).
# SetDisposition stands in for persuading Ten-Tongues (persuasion is tested elsewhere); it comes after his
# greeting, whose result script sets his disposition to 40. The donation needs the
# 3000 gold Evidence of Conspiracy pays. Ref FormIDs carry Tribunal.esm's slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tr08_hlaalu --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tr09_journalist
run
player->PositionCell 193 -138 -90 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room"
until 600 "Tienius Delitian"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Tienius Delitian
ask anonymous writer
choose 1
choose 4
expect GetJournalIndex TR09_Journalist == 1
bye
run
player->PositionCell -29 203 -365 0 "Mournhold, Pawnbroker"
until 600 "Ten-Tongues_Weerhat"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Ten-Tongues_Weerhat
run
"Ten-Tongues_Weerhat"->SetDisposition 80
expect "Ten-Tongues_Weerhat"->GetDisposition >= 80
ask anonymous writer
expect GetJournalIndex TR09_Journalist == 20
bye
expect player->GetItemCount "Gold_001" >= 3000
run
player->PositionCell 3871 3987 15630 0 "Mournhold, Secret Office"
until 300 GetPCCell "Mournhold, Secret Office" == 1
until 600 "Trels Varis"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Trels Varis
choose 1
choose 7
expect GetJournalIndex TR09_Journalist == 60
bye
run
player->PositionCell 193 -138 -90 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room"
until 600 "Tienius Delitian"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Tienius Delitian
ask anonymous writer
choose 5
expect GetJournalIndex TR09_Journalist == 100
bye
end
